SUMMARY:[Registries of Deeds] Page updated: York County Registry of Deeds
DESCRIPTION:This page's content changed since the last check. Visit the pa
 ge directly to review the update.\n\nWhat changed (text excerpt):\nAdded:\
 n  + Historic York County documents\, maps intrigue adult ed. group\n  + O
 ld maps\, old deeds\, old documents: really old - 1733 old. Its enough to 
 make a history lovers heart go pitty-pat. And it did earlier this month wh
 en several members of a Bonny Eagle Adult Education class braved a prolifi
 c fall rainstorm to see for themselves some of the sorts of historical mat
 erial that helps shape how we live today.\n  + Tammy L Wells\n  + Nov 2\n 
  + 3 min read\nRemoved:\n  - County Commissioners mull future use of York 
 County Court House\n  - York County Court House in Alfred remains in use b
 ut with the 2023 exit of the state superior court\, there is more space th
 an the county departments housed there need. County Commissioners Dec. 3 d
 iscussed an idea that would see Sanford Housing Authority acquire the buil
 ding and create senior apartments inside in exchange for the SHA-owned for
 mer Springvale District Court. A public hearing may be forthcoming in the 
 new year.\n  - Tammy L Wells\n  - Dec 9\, 2025\n  - 3 min read\nhttps://ww
 w.yorkcountymaine.gov/registry-of-deeds
